          4 OK         Error-only instrumentation on the two session-context procedures                                                                                                                                         0 of 2 have the wrong shape. Error-only means the CATCH calls logs.uspRecordExecutionError and the procedure opens NO start row: one row per request would be roughly 4.3 million a day at fifty requests a second. G-22. LastSeenUtc is the per-request record instead.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
          4 OK         Full instrumentation on the two maintenance procedures                                                                                                                                                   0 of 2 have the wrong shape. These two are called by a person a few times a month, so every call earns a start row, a completion UPDATE and a transaction -- and a maintenance bypass nobody can account for afterwards is the failure this whole file exists to prevent.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
          4 OK         auth.uspSetSessionContext refuses a hash that is not 32 bytes (E-50100)                                                                                                                                  Error 50100. A short binary is silently right-padded by an implicit conversion, so the length is checked rather than assumed: without this, 0x00 would be compared against every stored hash, match none of them, and the caller would be told there was no such session.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
          4 OK         auth.uspSetSessionContext refuses an unknown session (E-50020)                                                                                                                                           Error 50020. This is the whole procedure running end to end -- the session SELECT, the refusal, the CATCH and an orphan logs.ExecutionLog row with no start row before it -- without setting a single key. Appendix B: 50020 and 50023 are separate numbers because the UI does different things with them, which is why this procedure reads auth.UserSession itself instead of calling auth.udfResolveSessionUser.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
          4 OK         auth.uspClearSessionContext runs and reports no identity on this connection                                                                                                                              @IdentityKeysRemain = 0, error 0. 0 is the expected answer for a deployment connection, which is nobody. Clearing when nothing is set is a no-op by design: the pooled-connection case cannot know what the last request left behind.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
          4 OK         auth.uspBeginMaintenanceSession refuses the deploying principal (E-50070)                                                                                                                                Error 50070. IS_ROLEMEMBER (N'rlsBypassRole') = 0. The positive path -- a user WITHOUT LOGIN added to rlsBypassRole, the MaintenanceBypass row, the bypass, the MaintenanceBypassEnded row -- is exercised in database/_tests/060_*.sql.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
          4 OK         The refused bypass set no session key                                                                                                                                                                    SESSION_CONTEXT (N'BypassRowSecurity') must still be NULL on this connection. Session context is not transactional, so a key set before a refusal would survive the rollback that follows it -- which is exactly why that procedure sets the key AFTER its COMMIT and not inside its work block.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
          4 OK         The refusals reached logs.ExecutionLog                                                                                                                                                                   3 failed row(s) recorded by the probes above in the last five minutes; three are expected. Rule 8 is not decoration: there is no separate error table -- logs.uspRecordExecutionError writes the error columns of logs.ExecutionLog, and for an error-only procedure that row is the ONLY evidence a request was refused and why. Two of these three rows have no start row before them, which is the orphan shape @ContextMessage exists to explain to whoever reads them.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
          4 OK         MS_Description on the session procedures                                                                                                                                                                 4 of 4 procedures carry a description. Conventions rule 4.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
          4 OK         EXECUTE granted to applicationRole                                                                                                                                                                       2 of 2. uspSetSessionContext and uspClearSessionContext. The application reaches session context through these two and through nothing else -- INV-11.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
          4 OK         EXECUTE granted to rlsBypassRole                                                                                                                                                                         2 of 2. uspBeginMaintenanceSession and uspEndMaintenanceSession, and NOT applicationRole: an application one EXEC away from reading every tenant is what section 21 exists to prevent.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
          4 OK         CK_logs_AuthenticationEvent_EventType accepts the maintenance events                                                                                                                                     MaintenanceBypass and MaintenanceBypassEnded are both in the closed vocabulary.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         


